uplink-bluehardsuit-name = Storm-blue Pressure Suit
uplink-bluehardsuit-desc = A NT-Certified pressure suit graded for 11 kilometers of ocean pressure. It's painted in NT Storm Blue.

uplink-bulletproof-vest-name = Type-III Bulletproof Vest
uplink-bulletproof-vest-desc = A durable vest designed to protect against projectile weaponry and minor explosives. Just don't expect it to protect much else.

uplink-voice-mask-name = Voice Mask
uplink-voice-mask-desc = A gas mask that lets you adjust your voice to whoever you can think of. Also utilizes 'borrowed' chameleon technology.

uplink-clothing-thieving-gloves-name = Thieving Gloves
uplink-clothing-thieving-gloves-desc = Discretely steal from pockets and increase your thieving technique with these fancy new gloves, all while looking like normal gloves!
